# Findings to skip in the Trivy scans: a CVE, GHSA or check ID (e.g. DS-0002), one per line.
# Reason and owner go on a comment line above it, an expiry on the ID line, e.g.:
#
# CVE-2026-12345 exp:2026-12-31

# HIGH findings in the fleet binary: its Go modules and the stdlib of the Go version, all fixed in
# upstream fleetdm/fleet. Fix: bump go.mod to the versions below, plus two code changes upstream made
# with them: orbit/pkg/packaging/linux_shared.go for the nfpm 2.29 API, and semconv v1.41.0 for the
# otel 1.44 that go mod tidy pulls in. Owner: @flamingo-stack/devops-engineers

